data: {"id": "df89e635aae049fe-final", "run_id": "df89e635aae049fe", "seq": 1663, "ts_ms": 1788421771148, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w 处于 ContainerCreating 状态并卡住 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-4cd5b8e0c10d) | 直接指明 `input` 卷挂载失败的具体原因是 ConfigMap 缺失 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | Pod 配置了 volume `input` 引用 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，且默认为非 Optional (fact-eb54a5c67408) | 确认 Pod 启动机制强制依赖该缺失资源，导致挂载阻塞 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `ContainerCreating` 且 `timed out waiting for the condition` (fact-ab16ee491295) | 现象级证据：容器处于阻塞等待状态，与 FailedMount 一致 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `configmaps \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-3d3e1f3c3c1e) | 补充事实：目标 ConfigMap 在命名空间中确实不存在 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = `ContainerCreating` (fact-de8a96c43fcf) | 外部验证 Pod 卡在创建阶段的现状 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（#1）与 Pod 配置（#2）构成了明确的因果联系：因为 ConfigMap 不存在，导致 Pod spec 中定义的 Volume 挂载失败，进而直接引发 K8s 状态变更（#3）并表现为 Pod 持续处于 `ContainerCreating` 阻塞态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod spec 声明引用不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → kubelet MountVolume 机制检测到资源缺失并报错 → FailedMount 事件触发并导致挂载超时 → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：** Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 的 Volume `input` 错误地引用了不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`。\n\n该配置错误导致 kubelet 在初始化容器时无法找到挂载源，从而持续失败并重试，表现为 Pod 始终处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态。证据链中 K8s Event (`FailedMount` -> `configmap ... not found`) 与 Pod 配置（未设置 `optional: true`）完全吻合，构成了闭环诊断。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 10.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 554.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 49.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w: 49.0s (Evidence 40.7s, RCA 8.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 612.057, "metrics": {"run_id": "df89e635aae049fe", "mttr": {"value": "10.2m", "seconds": 612.0574350357056, "pass": false, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 612057.4350357056, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 607914.1130447388, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 16, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 7213.529825210571, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 35